.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
node_modules/
.pytest_cache/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
build/
dist/
Inputs/**
raw/**
index/**
runs/**
tmp/**
# Entity content — keep only system files (schema/how-to + audit log).
# catalog.md (id→name tables), the entity notes, and decision ADRs are content
# and must NOT reach the remote.
entities/*/*.md
!entities/*/index.md
!entities/*/log.md

# Built wiki apps embed the entire dataset (names + emails) — keep them out of the
# repo. The generators in scripts/ rebuild them locally into Apps/.
Apps/*.html
